  "limitations": [
    "Development-exposed on both SWE corpora; not a confirmation claim.",
    "The repo_bin arm is a diagnostic aggregate, NOT the shipped predictor: it carries no public prior and no exact/prefix layer, and it was scored in a single within-cohort causal pass. Its utility is therefore NOT comparable to the fit/eval-orientation gate result, and it is not a candidate.",
    "Turning repo x binary into runtime arbitration requires implementation, independent review, and a gated read before any of these numbers transfer.",
    "The oracle bounds features that are functions of the repository alone. It does not bound a feature interacting with the command, such as how many test files a specific argv path expands to."
  ]
